{"resourceIdentifier":"4239","resourceName":"WUHE BIOGAS RECOVERY AND UTILIZATION PROJECT","description":"Wuhe Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project (hereinafter referred to as the project) locates in Wuhe County, Bengbu City, Anhui Province, P.R China. The project is owned and implemented by Modern Energy Wuhe Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as the project owner). The project is to collect methane from manure treatment at Modern Farming Wuhe Farm in Wuhe County, Bengbu City, Anhui Province. The project treats the raw manure from 18,000 dairy cows annually by anaerobic digester, and uses the biogas generated during the treatment process for power generation. The electricity generated by the project will be transmitted to East China Power Grid (ECPG). The project is expected to produce 80,500 m3 biogas per day. All the manure is collected and transferred to the anaerobic digester. After anaerobic digestion, the digestate is sent out and used for agriculture fertilization aerobically in the nearby farmlands.","location":{"latitude":33.101074,"longitude":117.971473},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-09-04","endExclusive":"2023-10-05","endInclusive":"2023-10-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4239"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Anhui"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Modern Energy Wuhe Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 13814278952"},{"type":"string","value":"guishaoqin@favfam.cn"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"173943"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","va